                "content": "React Compiler\nReact Quiz\nReact Exercises\nReact Syllabus\nReact Study Plan\nReact Server\nReact Interview Prep\nReact Bootcamp\n\nny:-->\n\n ny:-->\n\nny:-->\n\nReact ES6 Arrow Functions\n\n❮ Previous\nNext ❯",
