                "content": "To add initial values to the input fields in the example above,\n add the proper keys and values to the useState object:\n\n Example:\n Use initial values for firstname and lastname:\n\n function MyForm() {\n const [inputs, setInputs] = useState({\n firstname: 'John',\n lastname: 'Doe'\n });\n\n ...\n\nRun \nExample »\n\n❮ Previous\nNext ❯\n\n ★\n\n +1\n\n Sign in to track progress\n\n REMOVE ADS",
