                "content": "Just like with CSS Modules, styles created in CSS-in-JS are scoped to the component.\n\nThey are given unique names and can only be used in the component that imports them.\n\nIf we view the source of the page in the example above, the buttons will have unique class names\n like bSOFjJ\n and pkxvl,\n and will be refering to the CSS with the same unique class names in the style section.",
